---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact — K2Labs"
  description="Get in touch with K2Labs to collaborate on community-driven research and ethical technology development."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold">Contact</h1>

    <p class="mt-8 text-lg text-brand-off/80">
      K2Labs is a community-driven research initiative. We welcome individuals
      who want to learn by building and contribute to solutions that address
      real-world challenges.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-brand-off/80">
      We encourage participation from:
    </p>

    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc list-inside text-brand-off/80 space-y-2">
      <li>Students interested in hands-on research and problem solving</li>
      <li>Volunteers who want to contribute skills or time</li>
      <li>Domain experts willing to guide, review, or mentor</li>
      <li>Communities seeking practical, technology-assisted solutions</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-8 text-brand-off/80">
      If you are interested in collaborating or learning more about our work,
      please reach out to us at:
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4">
      <a
        href="mailto:contact@k2labs.in"
        class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-off underline hover:text-brand-off"
      >
        contact@k2labs.in
      </a>
    </p>

    <p class="mt-8 text-brand-grey text-sm">
      We review all messages and respond where collaboration aligns with our
      current research focus and capacity.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
